 "notes": "Hold-out (H2-D20), read before the extractor ran. Koa, RPC-style paths. Routes, scope: the documents, collections and users modules (64 routes). Each module's @koa/router registers router.post(\"documents.info\", auth(), validate(..), handler) — the path without a leading slash —, server/routes/api/index.ts mounts every module with router.use(\"/\", x.routes()) on the API router, served by a Koa app that services/web.ts mounts with app.use(mount(\"/api\", api)): /api/documents.info. Calls, scope: the three matching MobX stores (19 calls): client.post(\"/documents.info\", ..) on the app's own ApiClient, whose baseUrl defaults to \"/api\" in its constructor (prefix-in-client-wrapper). Not expected: client.post(`/users.${action}`, ..) (the action named at runtime) and the base Store's `/${this.apiEndpoint}.create` (a field per store).",
